<title>USA: Glimcher Realty Trust to expand Ohio mall.</title>
<headline>Glimcher Realty Trust to expand Ohio mall.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, Ohio 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Glimcher Realty Trust said Monday it will expand its Indian Mound Mall in Heath, Ohio.</p>
<p>The company said over 110,000 square feet of gross leasable area will be added to build a full-service Sears store and for expansion of the mall's theater complex.</p>
<p>The company said the expansions will increase the mall's total gross leasable area from 416,180 square feet to over 531,000 square feet.</p>
<p>The company said ground work began earlier this month.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
